          "text": "Raising lambda-k lowers the flow of consumer goods immediately and raises the growth of capacity. The cost is borne by whoever is alive during the transition; the benefit accrues to whoever is alive afterwards. This is a distributional decision dressed as a technical one, and the Plan documents are unusually candid that it will be uncomfortable.",
