          "text": "The first move is macroeconomic: cut the fiscal deficit, stop monetising it, devalue to a competitive rate. This is the painful part and it comes first, because liberalising an economy with an unfinanced deficit produces a currency crisis rather than a reallocation. It is also the part that arrives as a condition on a loan rather than as a domestic decision.",
