          "text": "Where Europeans died in large numbers from malaria and yellow fever, they did not settle in numbers. Where they survived, they came. The mortality was a fact about the pathogen rather than about the society, which is why it can serve as an instrument: it moves institutions without plausibly moving income today by any other route.",
